==Trivia==
*[[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.4 Update|Version 2.0.4]] reduced Island Cat's base health from 2,100 to 1,400 and base attack from 540 to 360, and increased base recharge from 390f<sup>13s</sup> to 510f<sup>17s</sup>.
*[[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.9 Update|Version 2.0.9]] gave Island Cat the ability to cause [[Critical Hit]]s.
*Whale Cat is a [[wikipedia:Toothed whale|toothed whale]] while [[Li'l Fish Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Whale Cat]] is a [[wikipedia:Baleen whale|baleen whale]].
*Island Cat may be a reference to the [[wikipedia:Aspidochelone|Aspidochelone]] as they are both living islands.
*According to [[Reindeer Fish Cat (Rare Cat)|Sashimi Cat]]'s description, Fish Cat is the only Cat Unit with [[wikipedia:Service star|service stars]].
*Prior to [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]], Fish Cat's descriptions read as follows:
